# Rust
/target
# Parallel builds use their own target directories to avoid fighting
# over cargo's lock when several models are being written at once.
/target-*

# Node
node_modules/
web/dist/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# Reference imagery for the dossiers.
#
# The research files measure faceplates and read curves off manufacturer
# photographs, manual scans and patent sheets. Those are other companies'
# copyrighted material and this repository is public, so the images stay out
# of it and every dossier cites the URL it took each figure from instead. A
# measurement that cannot be re-checked from its cited source is a fault in
# the dossier, not a reason to commit the image.
research/ref/

# IDE and OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
